==Battleground==
*10 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**100 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 2.67~4 seconds<sup>80f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Ange Lackey]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**5 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is essentially [[Pilgrim Agitators]] reborn, except with new Knockback enemies not included in that stage, Gokurakko and Ange Lackey, making their appearance here.

While this stage might seem annoying given the constant Knockbacks and the dual threat of Gokurakko and Lackey, [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] take care of them easily. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] with Research combos can serve as your main meatshield for the knockback horde, while [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]], [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] can deal with the other pushing enemies. Make sure to bring [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to abuse the Trolly Bloggers, and this stage will be cleared without much trouble.

